---
// Diagrama estático: dividir em metades, listar somas, ordenar uma lista, combinar.
---
<figure class="not-prose my-8 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 sm:p-6">
  <figcaption class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Meet in the middle em 3 passos</figcaption>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 250" class="w-full" role="img" aria-label="Diagrama do meet in the middle">
    <g font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="13">
      <rect x="20" y="16" width="600" height="34" rx="7" fill="var(--c-surface-2)" stroke="var(--c-line)" />
      <line x1="320" y1="10" x2="320" y2="56" stroke="var(--c-accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 3" />
      <text x="170" y="38" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-fg)">a₀ … a₁₉ (metade A)</text>
      <text x="470" y="38" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-fg)">a₂₀ … a₃₉ (metade B)</text>

      <path d="M170 56 V86" stroke="var(--c-muted)" marker-end="url(#arr)" />
      <path d="M470 56 V86" stroke="var(--c-muted)" marker-end="url(#arr)" />
      <rect x="40" y="92" width="260" height="46" rx="7" fill="var(--c-bg)" stroke="var(--c-line)" />
      <text x="170" y="112" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-fg)">somasA: 2²⁰ valores</text>
      <text x="170" y="129" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-faint)" font-size="11">gerar todas: O(2^(n/2))</text>
      <rect x="340" y="92" width="260" height="46" rx="7" fill="var(--c-bg)" stroke="var(--c-accent)" />
      <text x="470" y="112" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-fg)">somasB: 2²⁰ valores, ORDENADA</text>
      <text x="470" y="129" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-faint)" font-size="11">sort: O(2^(n/2) · n)</text>

      <path d="M170 138 V176 H300" stroke="var(--c-muted)" fill="none" />
      <path d="M470 138 V176 H340" stroke="var(--c-muted)" fill="none" />
      <rect x="150" y="182" width="340" height="52" rx="7" fill="var(--c-bg)" stroke="var(--c-ok)" />
      <text x="320" y="204" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-fg)">para cada s em somasA: busca binária</text>
      <text x="320" y="222" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--c-fg)">em somasB pelo par que completa s</text>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--c-muted)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
  </svg>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">2⁴⁰ ≈ 1,1·10¹² combinações viram 2 · 2²⁰ ≈ 2·10⁶ somas e ~2·10⁶ · 20 passos de busca binária.</p>
</figure>
